      "content": "that's a good start, thanks. but i pretty much already know that part lol. i want to dig a bit deeper into the \"strengthening democracy\" bit. u mentioned they helped with voting rights, but what about the way unions changed how politics actually works? like, did their influence basically force the government to listen to more people instead of just the big corporations?",
